```mermaid
flowchart TB
  %% Change Management Process (Lewin) - Flow Chart

  U[Unfreeze]
  C[Change]
  R[Re-freeze]

  U --> C --> R

  Udesc["To reduce forces and change existing attitudes which manintain behaviour in present form/recognising the need for change"]
  Usteps["1. Initial problem identification<br/>2. Preparing the ground and Communication<br/>3. Obtaining data"]

  Cdesc["Development of new attitudes or behaviour and implemeting change"]
  Csteps["3. Obtaining data<br/>4. Problem diagnosis<br/>5. Action planning<br/>6. Implementation<br/>7. Follow up and stabilisation<br/>8. Assessment of consequences"]

  Rdesc["Consolidating the change at a new level and reinforcement through supporting mechanisms/ policies/ structure/ organisational norms"]
  Rsteps["8. Assessment of consequences<br/>9. Ongoing monitoring<br/>10. Learning from process"]

  U --- Udesc
  U --- Usteps

  C --- Cdesc
  C --- Csteps

  R --- Rdesc
  R --- Rsteps

  %% Styling
  classDef stageU fill:#f7e6c8,stroke:#f07a00,stroke-width:3px,color:#000;
